{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Paused_Marketing.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>KABUKI FIRE! </i></strong>Every year, during the peak of the rainy season, the world's best shooters gather on a zombie infested island, to participate in a lethal challenge. Armed with a set of pistols, participants are locked inside an abandoned village, to fight hordes of fiercely attacking creatures like Kabuki Dragons and Zombie Mosquitoes. One of the contestants is young yakuza Kamoku Shimazu. She enters the competition to proof her fighting skills and earn the trust of the evil oyabun Jakarta, with the purpose to revenge her father's death!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Comic_3.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/The_Gameplay.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your reflexes and precision in this quirky hand-painted 2D shoot 'em up. The goal is to score points by shooting enemies and bonus objects within a time frame of 5 minutes. Climb up the high-score table and reach the rank of black belt (or even the legendary red belt). As the time counter progresses, your enemies are getting more aggressive and are furiously throwing dragon fire and zombie slime at you. Although you have unlimited ammo at your disposal, you are required to reload your gun regularly! Some enemies leave bonus objects in the arena after they vanish. These bonuses can be cached and stored in the inventory or released immediately as they appear. The arsenal of bonuses include...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Chain Bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mighty Hammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ice Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Razor Blades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Rockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Plasma Storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Distracting Doll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Comic_1.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/The_Features.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique hand-painted 2D artwork</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many bonus-objects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>5 minutes playtime per game</strong> (perfect for your lunch-break!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martial arts style</strong> <strong>belt system</strong> (start as a white belt novice and reach the higher ranks!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to learn</strong> but <strong>hard to master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Revenge_Sign.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Vertical_Capsule_Description__small.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><