h the higher ranks!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to learn</strong> but <strong>hard to master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Revenge_Sign.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Vertical_Capsule_Description__small.png?t=1749319304\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Atmosphere Entertainment Studios Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/ef04fb15479db7b5e14eacc97989bfe5d61644af/header.jpg?t=1749319304","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"KABUKI FIRE \u00a9 2025 Atmosphere Entertainment Studios Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257080351,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080351/movie480.mp4?t=1748014515","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080351/movie_max.mp4?t=1748014515"},"name":"Kabuki Fire Gameplay_01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257080351/d8617555e9849419df996a809ac0f3411ae52ee9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748014515","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080351/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748014515","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080351/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748014515"}}],"name":"KABUKI FIRE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 10, 8, 7, Vista, XP, 2000, 98